WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:02.960
- [Narrator] A COVID-19
variant first detected

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.250
in India in October of 2020

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.780
has quickly spread around the world

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.010
and been detected in nearly 100 countries

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.400
within 10 months.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.380
As of July, more than
80% of known COVID cases

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.960
in the US are caused by the Delta variant.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.900
- The Delta variant is
currently the greatest threat

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.860
in the US to our attempt
to eliminate COVID-19.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.150
- The Delta variant is
both more transmissible

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.300
and possibly more severe.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.360
- [Narrator] Studies have
shown that some COVID vaccines

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.650
are effective at preventing
symptomatic illnesses

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.250
caused by the strain.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.640
Nevertheless, as of July,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.330
cases are on the rise in countries

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.570
where a large part of the
population is vaccinated.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.530
Even countries that have
been previously spared

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.350
from the pandemic are now battling

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.610
a ferocious wave of infections.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.670
We look at some moment in key countries

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.180
to understand why the
deadly outbreak of Delta

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.500
is not just threatening
the economic recovery

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.013
but also the return to
normal around the world.

00:00:58.688 --> 00:01:01.580
First, we go back to October of 2020.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.350
Health authorities say the Delta variant

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:05.370
was first detected here in the state

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.023
of Maharashtra in India.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.880
By the spring, the
number of cases in India

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.100
began ticking up.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.340
Then from March to May,

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.100
infections jumped 20-fold,

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.240
plunging the country in disarray.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.480
- [Betsy] It ripped through the country.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:22.390
Thousands and thousands of
new infections every day.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.690
Hospitals were completely overwhelmed

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:26.280
and they were running out of oxygen

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:29.558
for patients who needed help breathing.

00:01:29.558 --> 00:01:33.475
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.530
- [Narrator] Public health experts blamed

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.830
India's deadly wave on several factors.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:40.980
There were political
rallies for state elections

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.410
that drew large crowds.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.690
There was also a religious
festival in April

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.610
when millions of Hindus gathered to bathe

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:47.793
in the Ganges River.

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:50.420
And then a few days later,

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.300
the government relaxed safety measures

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.960
like mask wearing and social distancing.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.810
But scientists say

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:58.070
what really helped
accelerate the case load

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.620
was Delta variant's molecular composition

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.040
and its nine key mutations
in the protein spikes

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.630
that surround the virus.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.640
Mutations on these spikes allow the varies

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.740
to invade human cells more easily,

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.980
making the Delta variant about 50%

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.530
more transmissible than others.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.200
By June 1st, the variant
wasn't only in India

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.530
but detected in more than 60 countries.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:19.470
And the United Kingdom

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.020
was one of the first Western countries

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.240
to see an alarming increase in cases

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.430
as Delta became the dominant strain.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.880
- We're seeing cases growing
by about 64% per week

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:31.730
and in the worst affected areas,

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:33.690
it's doubling every week.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.310
- [Narrator] What
surprised health officials

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:38.620
was that around 75% of the
adult British population

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.820
had already received at
least one dose of a vaccine

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.750
and about 50% was fully vaccinated.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.938
- The UK's a really unfortunate situation.

00:02:46.938 --> 00:02:49.920
There are good levels of vaccination there

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.060
but the variant took off anyway.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.530
- [Narrator] And that was
partly because vaccines

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:55.970
were reacting differently to Delta

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:58.020
than they had to earlier strains.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.380
By mid-June, studies showed

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.150
that one dose of some vaccines

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:02.980
was 17% less effective

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.940
at preventing symptomatic
illnesses caused by Delta.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.300
But two doses provided good protection.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.340
- The more the Delta variant
is allowed to spread,

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:14.530
the greater the risk of mutations,

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.920
which would evade the
vaccines or evade treatments.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:22.140
And we'd kind of almost
be back to the beginning.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:22.973
- [Narrator] By late June,

00:03:22.973 --> 00:03:24.250
Delta was detected in countries

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.890
that had been slower to vaccinate,

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.730
in part because they had
been spared the brunt

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:28.660
of the pandemic

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.640
and cases began rising in these places.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.220
Australia and Thailand imposed lockdowns.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:37.040
Even Japan decided to ban
spectators at the Olympics

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.023
because of a new wave of infections.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.370
- There are many, many, many countries

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:44.440
that don't have access to vaccine yet.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.940
Not many people in the
population are vaccinated.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.590
And this is the huge
concern about this variant.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:52.711
That it's just going to rip
through these countries.

00:03:52.711 --> 00:03:54.270
- [Narrator] Meanwhile, in the US,

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.970
as people headed into
their 4th of July weekend,

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:59.770
the Delta variant had
become the dominant strain.

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.030
People were traveling again

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.540
and many stopped wearing masks

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.730
after the CDC said it wasn't necessary

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.790
for those who were fully vaccinated.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:08.550
The variant has mostly spread to areas

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:11.130
where vaccination rates have been slow.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:12.200
In some parts of the country,

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.480
like in Los Angeles,
authorities have asked people

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.560
to wear masks in indoor public places,

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.880
regardless of vaccination status.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.050
But some public health
experts say the appetite

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:22.823
for another lockdown is low.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.986
- It's difficult to ask people

00:04:25.986 --> 00:04:28.570
to once again adopt these measures.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:32.680
The message is everybody
needs to get vaccinated.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.490
- [Narrator] So on July
4th, Biden urged people

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:35.680
to do just that

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:36.900
as the administration planned

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.150
to make it easier for
people to get their shots,

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.250
like sending more mobile
clinics to festivals

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.840
and sporting events.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.540
- While the virus hasn't been vanquished,

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:46.373
we know this,

00:04:47.423 --> 00:04:49.760
it no longer controls our lives.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.690
It no longer paralyzes our nation

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:57.143
and it's within our power to
make sure it never does again.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.490
- [Narrator] And that means
it's a race against time

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:02.860
to vaccinate more people around the world

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.486
before the coronavirus mutates against.

00:05:05.486 --> 00:05:08.069
(lively music)

